post_install() {
    cat <<'MESSAGE'
USB Update candidate installed alongside stable. DKMS must build successfully
for your running kernel before the adapter can be used.
Reconnect in USB Update, then run:
  sudo modprobe kirin_usb_update
  kirin-usb-update-probe --open-close
The probe does not write firmware or invoke software testpoint.
Launch the candidate GUI with kirin-tool-unstable.
Hardware flashing remains unvalidated. Keep stable installed.
MESSAGE
}
post_upgrade() { post_install; }
